“From Noah’s family, as the Scripture testifies, the whole earth was re-peopled.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/120115.htm
)

“After the deluge, all mankind were again derived from the sons of Noah.”
(Source: https://penelope.uchicago.edu/josephus/ant-1.html
)

“All animals that breathe and all men descended from those preserved in the ark.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/0204.htm
)
